s24:s22,s19:pncan2d |- ( ( A : NN --> CC /\ J e. NN ) -> ( ( sum_ i e. ( 1 ... J ) ( A ` i ) + ( A ` ( J + 1 ) ) ) - sum_ i e. ( 1 ... J ) ( A ` i ) ) = ( A ` ( J + 1 ) ) )
